{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，衞侯之弟黑背率師侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"二、夏四月，五卜郊不從，乃不郊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"其言乃不郊何？不免牲，故言乃不郊也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"三、五月，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"四、齊人來媵。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"媵不書，此何以書？錄伯姬也。三國來媵非禮也，曷為皆以錄伯姬之辭言之？婦人以眾多為侈也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"五、丙午，晉侯獳卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"六、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_142_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_142","textTraditional":"七、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}